For the manual-review field tied to negative FCF streak and path to positive FCF:
• if the negative-FCF streak is unknown, the manual-review field = None
• if the negative-FCF streak is False, the manual-review field = False
• if the negative-FCF streak is True and the documented path to positive FCF is unresolved, the
manual-review field = True
• if the negative-FCF streak is True and the documented path to positive FCF is already
resolved, the manual-review field = False
This lock uses the already-approved documented-path concept and does not introduce a new
